    "text": "Do I need to verify my identity?\nYes. You must complete identity verification before you can receive a Ready Card.\nCompleting identity verification does not affect the self-custodial nature of your wallet. You remain in control of your private keys and your funds at all times.\nUnlike many crypto cards, Ready never holds or controls your funds. Your assets remain in your self-custodial wallet until you authorize a payment.",
